stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Confirmed: Workshop accepts booking
    Pending --> Cancelled: Booking rejected or cancelled
    Confirmed --> Inspection: Vehicle received or customer arrives
    Inspection --> WaitingApproval: Estimate submitted with evidence
    WaitingApproval --> Inspection: Estimate revised before approval
    WaitingApproval --> Cancelled: Customer rejects estimate
    WaitingApproval --> Approved: Customer approves estimate
    Approved --> InProgress: Service payment is recorded
    InProgress --> Completed: Mechanic records completed work
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
